00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.367
I thought your first name was Marie.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.258
- No.

00:00:55.258 --> 00:00:56.673
Oh, my mother was Olive.

00:00:56.673 --> 00:00:58.784
And so I'm the only girl Olive Marie.

00:00:58.784 --> 00:00:59.720
- Oh.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:00.675
- But when I was little,

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:02.610
I thought that Rudolph
was about me, because;

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.859
♪Olive the other reindeer. ♪

00:01:04.859 --> 00:01:07.180
