confused 'cause it's Rudolph.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.560
It's Rudolph. I was like,
how did you get that?

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.899
Olive, the other reindeer?

00:01:20.899 --> 00:01:21.910
Oh my gosh!

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.630
I thought it was a girl.I love that.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.849
