Rudolf. That's amazing.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.926
I love that.

00:01:30.926 --> 00:01:34.235
Wait. Tell us about the song
you're performing for us today.

00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:35.350
Cause I love the prayer.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:36.233
