00:01:37.137 --> 00:01:38.699
I was listening to your rehearsal.

00:01:38.699 --> 00:01:39.532
It was so magical and beautiful.

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.045
And it's a big song and you
sound different than how

00:01:41.045 --> 00:01:42.914
