legit opera classical,

00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:08.993
and that's kind of what
this was 20 years to do it.

00:02:09.854 --> 00:02:11.605
But I love the prayer.

00:02:11.605 --> 00:02:12.438
Initially I'm one of the founders of

00:02:12.438 --> 00:02:13.271
"Children's Miracle Network"

00:02:13.271 --> 00:02:15.729
- Ya. Which is so cool.( crowd clapping)

00:02:15.729 --> 00:02:17.566
